# gta6-game

[![make.fun · gta6-01](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)
[![rank](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/745906790xf-cpu/gta6-game/rank.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01/leaderboard?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)
[![reward](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/745906790xf-cpu/gta6-game/reward.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)

Neon Harbor is an original top-down open-world crime game set in Port Solace: explore the city on foot and by car, steal vehicles, run five story missions for fixer Mara Voss, and outdrive a wanted-star police system across a full day-night cycle.

## Run it

```sh
node serve.ts
```

Then open http://localhost:8080 in a desktop browser.

